      "side": 1,
      "message": "Formerly, if the decode failed, the run was not considered a failure. I assume this was because decode failures were a thing, and would not be considered an error. Is this no longer the case?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 81,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 81,
