      "writtenOn": "2024-11-25T21:30:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Failure returns in this callback/wrapper indicate that the fuzzing pass failed to run to completion in some manner. This signals up to the calling code that it should not perform post-run validation.\n\nIt does not indicate a failure that would lead to a issue/case being report. TINT_ICE is used for that (e.g. in the Run() function where post-validation failures are raised to ICEs to signal a post-condition violation)",
      "parentUuid": "d2bd2064_c26dc8a9",
